.github
.claude
.kiro
.superpowers
.vscode
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.md
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.hypothesis
.uv-cache
deploy/.kubeconfig
target
models
data
docs
testdata
crates/*/tests
brag-output*
fiverr-screenshots
